  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Through practice, you have found ways to exert your will upon a particular etherheart.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ability to use the chosen etherheart</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against etherspells cast using the etherheart you select.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new etherheart.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
